<title>BRAZIL: Brazil power sector seen fully sold off by Dec '98.</title>
<headline>Brazil power sector seen fully sold off by Dec '98.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Mines and Energy Minister Raimundo Brito said the country's power sector will be fully privatized by December 1998, O Estado de Sao Paulo newspaper reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Raimundo Brito told the newspaper the ministry would tender out the construction of 14 hydroelectric plants and 10 thermoelectric units this year.</p>
<p>Those plants would require investments of 5.8 billion reais, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412</p>
</text>
